  "claim_ceiling": "仅定义 detached owner helper 的引用身份与状态机；无产品 producer、授权、读取、复制粘贴、提交或权限验收声明。",
  "runner_contract": {
    "object_graph": "objects.root is the exact top-level raw componentData array; its entries are component objects and their object identity is the raw target identity. clone_of creates a distinct JS array/object graph.",
    "ref_resolution": "A {\"ref\":\"objects.path\"} descriptor is resolved to the referenced JS object before invoking helper or a mutation step; it is never identity evidence.",
    "current_context": "getCurrentContext returns scalar loader facts plus canvasInstance and root references. The root reference is the exact raw top-level componentData array; no separately inferred topLevelComponents projection exists.",
    "setCurrentContext": "Shallow merge only named top-level properties, preserving all other current context properties; a supplied {ref} value is resolved to an actual reference.",
    "mutation_steps": "mutateArrayItem replaces one array entry with the referenced object; removeArrayItem removes the indexed entry.",
    "factory_epochs": "One lifecycle factory counts each successful begin as one epoch. begin while open rejects without replacement; after invalidation a new successful begin creates the next owner epoch; old handles remain terminal.",
    "assertions": "Assert owner/result shape, exact error, generation, current registration ids and token validity. The latest successful registration token is addressable as lastRegistrationToken in token validation steps. Ordinary reject preserves prior registration; lifecycle invalidation clears them. All cases assert source_read=false and paste_commit=false.",
    "component_query_rule": "A VQuery is matched only when component==='VQuery' and innerType==='VQuery'; the legacy/general `type` property is ignored.",
    "token_idempotence": "A second registerTarget with the same active targetId and the exact same raw object returns the exact same opaque token object; no additional registration or generation is created. A different object is not substituted.",
    "owner_validity_oracle": "For validate(owner), compare API OwnerValidity.reason to expected.reason. RegistrationResult and validateRegistration use expected.error. This fixture naming normalization does not require aliased runtime properties.",
    "foreign_owner": "objects.foreignOwner is a distinct object never issued by this factory; owner APIs return the exact unknown/OWNER_HANDLE_INVALID result shape."
  },
